{
 "brief": "Israeli occupation forces launched a wide-scale military operation across Jenin governorate in the northern West Bank early Monday morning, according to Shehab Wire. The forces raided multiple homes during the incursion, which encompassed several towns and areas throughout the governorate and extended into Jenin city proper.\n\nLocal sources confirmed the raids were underway, though the specific objectives and full scope of the operation remained unclear. The operation represents the latest in a pattern of Israeli military activity in the area.",
